124 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 93 0 R
/E (Very Large Scale Integration \(VLSI\) enables the integration of hundreds of thousands to billions of transistors onto a single microchip. In Application- Specific Integrated Circuit \(ASIC\) design, hardware is created following a structured pipeline. The ASIC design flow converts high-level specifications into physical silicon through distinct stages: System Specification, Register Transfer Level \(RTL\) Design, Behavioural/Functional Verification, Logic Synthesis, Physical Design \(floorplanning, placement, clock tree synthesis, and routing\), and Physical Signoff Verification. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
